# DrumMania 10th Mix: power-on after the install (start from drmn10m-install's NVRAM). NOTE 605
# (RTC-RAM cleared): Test goes on. The boot checks and data loading, then "Please call attendant":
# the multi-session unit can't be found. MAME's multi-session unit is an empty stub, so this is as
# far as MAME goes. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames.
game drmn10m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 10800 quit
